Fixed incorrect WhatsApp number format, completed missing Ukrainian translations for service labels and price sections, and redesigned image integration strategy to use all three assets (back.png, big-back.png, mini-icon.png) purposefully with proper visibility and blend modes.

## Changes

### Bug Fixes
- **WhatsApp links**: Corrected number to `+31633915100` across all 9 instances (booking buttons, service cards, contact section)
- **Ukrainian translations**: Added `data-translate` attributes to previously hardcoded elements:
  - Service labels: `Laser • Women` → `Лазер • Жінки`, etc.
  - Price group titles: `Bikini` → `Бікіні`, `Legs` → `Ноги`, etc.
  - All 30+ price item names
  - Footer location text
- **Translation function**: Refactored to use `data-translate` attributes for maintainability:
  ```js
  // Before: Manual element selection for each translatable text
  document.querySelector('.service-label').textContent = serviceData[i].label;

  // After: Attribute-driven translation
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-translate]').forEach(element => {
    const key = element.dataset.translate;
    if (t[key]) element.textContent = t[key];
  });
  ```

### Design Improvements
Replaced ineffective image usage (2.5% and 4% opacity) with strategic placement:

- **back.png** (8% opacity, multiply blend): Hero section background with gradient overlay
- **big-back.png** (6% opacity, soft-light blend): Featured/Price sections with parallax (desktop only)
- **mini-icon.png** (8-15% opacity): Floating decorative accents in price sections, contact block, and footer
- Added `@keyframes float` animation (6s ease-in-out)
- Mobile optimizations: Disabled parallax, reduced opacity, smaller decorative elements

```css
/* Hero section background */
.hero::before {
  background-image: url('back.png');
  opacity: 0.08;
  mix-blend-mode: multiply;
}

/* Section backgrounds with parallax */
.section#featured::before,
.section#prices::before {
  background-image: url('big-back.png');
  background-attachment: fixed;
  opacity: 0.06;
  mix-blend-mode: soft-light;
}

/* Floating decorative accent */
.price-section::after {
  background-image: url('mini-icon.png');
  opacity: 0.12;
  animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
```

